00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:04.760
it's always been really annoying to talk&nbsp;
about shampoos because the way they work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:08.840
is really complicated it's the ingredients&nbsp;
working together I talked about it a bit in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:14.080
my shampoo science video it is more about the&nbsp;
overall formula and so the ratio of different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:18.440
ingredients makes a huge difference and you&nbsp;
can't just tell that from an ingredients list

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:23.120
I've tried maybe 50 new shampoos as part&nbsp;
of this quest to work out the holy grail&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:28.160
irritated scalp shampoos the only real patterns&nbsp;
I found are these maybe these will help you

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:33.120
firstly avoiding MI and MCI and these are&nbsp;
really common preservatives I'll put their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:37.520
full names here a lot of people are allergic to&nbsp;
them they are some of the most common allergens&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:41.720
in beauty products and it's annoying&nbsp;
because they are in a lot of shampoos

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:46.400
the other big thing that helped me is using&nbsp;
shampoos with ingredients that control yeast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:51.960
you might have heard of malassezia yeast this is&nbsp;
the thing that overgrows and causes dandruff but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:56.720
this yeast can also cause irritation even&nbsp;
without getting full-on dandruff flakes

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:00.520
one relatively new ingredient that&nbsp;
I've been appreciating is piroctone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:04.400
olamine this has come in because it's&nbsp;
replacing zinc pyrithione which was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:09.160
the old super popular anti-dandruff&nbsp;
ingredient that got limited in the EU

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:13.440
this isn't quite as powerful but it is&nbsp;
really nice in formulas because it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:17.720
just really bland like you can't tell&nbsp;
that it is an anti-dandruff shampoo

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:21.800
some of my favorite shampoos for this are&nbsp;
listed here but I've also tried shampoos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:28.800
