terrible memories so I don't love using it

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:47.280
but this is one of the least sulfur&nbsp;
smelling selenium sulfide shampoos&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:52.520
I've used and the effect does last longer so I&nbsp;
